EmitNameModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Encodes a name in WASM format (length-prefixed): U32LEB(length) + name bytes. Used for the name section and imports/exports.
    Provides: EmitName(lst) -> out. lst — name byte list; returns [U32LEB(len)] + lst.
    DependsOn: EmitU32LEB (length prefix).
    Composition: Native Include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir (Path: ../EmitName/EmitName.sir).
    Notes: the name here is already bytes (UTF-8); the function only adds the length prefix.
